<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday as banks were shut for the May Day national holiday.</p>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed unchanged at 43.7495/7500 to the dollar in interbank trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Saturday after Moslem Friday weekend.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
